      "reviewer": "OpenAI Codex",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T12:59:16Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and call trace, Loan creation receipt, bytecode at deployment and immediately before the incident, runtime disassembly, verified Loan source, onchain configuration, and the commit-pinned reproduction. Loan 0xae7b6514af26bcb2332fea53b8dd57bc13a7838e is a direct contract whose runtime is byte-identical at both anchors and contains no DELEGATECALL or SELFDESTRUCT. The trace executes borrow(uint256,uint256) 57 times and redeem(uint256) 55 times. borrowRates[0]=80 permits zero-duration orders; redeem allows duration zero immediately. Each borrow transfers USDT to the borrower, directs the MO/USDT pair to burn 90% of the borrowed MO amount and send 10% to Loan, then syncs the pair. Reusing returned MO collapses the pair's MO reserve. Exact receipt deltas establish gross losses of 331,465.404544 USDT from Loan and 413,837.515343 USDT from the pair."
    },
